# SPFx build output — the .sppkg is a build artifact, rebuilt from source
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
node_modules
dist
lib
lib-dts
lib-commonjs
lib-esm
jest-output
release
solution
temp
*.sppkg
.heft
coverage
.DS_Store
.vs
bin
obj
*.resx.ts
*.scss.ts

# The repo root ignores config.json (that is the app's runtime config, written
# by /admin). This one is SPFx build configuration and must be tracked.
!config/config.json

# The prebuilt package is committed on purpose so the .sppkg can be installed
# without a full SPFx toolchain install — see docs/SHAREPOINT.md.
!prebuilt/
!prebuilt/*.sppkg
